{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔～心跳得好快、心跳得好快喔！明白明白安潔非常明白的！」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0311", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是也不能一直閉著眼睛，就這樣走過去的話會撞到牆壁的。所以各位，聽安潔數一二三……」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0312", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，安潔，妳的成績進步了呢。」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0761", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理同學妳偷跑啦！安潔還沒有做好心理準備的說！」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0313", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "週休結束的今天，是公佈考試結果的日子。", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "於是，安潔領隊帶大家來看貼在走廊上的名次表。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔想說一個人看會害怕所以才帶大家一起來的～一大早就把安潔的玻璃心打碎太過分了啦愛理同學～！」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0314", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可是，大家早就都看到了。」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0762", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……比預想的成績還要好太多了……」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被瀨名教導念書的結果顯而易見。甚至我都有點傻眼了。", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小乾其實頭腦也很好吧？我輸了一大截欸～」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "ht0166", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是當然的啊！區區男人想贏過我，未免也太看得起自己了！」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "sn0113", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是但是小紗同學，妳輸給新吾同學了呢♪」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0315", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咕唔唔！」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "sn0114", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且安潔的名次真的進步好多……啊啊，愛理同學謝謝妳……」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0316", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可恨的瓜生，是男人就給我想色色的事情然後把英語單字都忘光光啦……」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "sn0115", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，大家～」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "mu0202", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～！」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "pn0069", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀呀，美羽學姊櫻乃學妹熊喵小姐！」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0317", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其他年級的天羽學姊和櫻乃也來了，安潔和乾同學立刻迎了上去。", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請看，安潔名次進步了喔！這樣一來安潔就不會再被說『什麼都好就是笨』，是個能幹的女僕了♪」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0318", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊抱歉！我輸給瓜生那個色情混帳了，但是、但是名次進步了喔……！」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "sn0116", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，大家很努力喔，小菜夏和小紗凪都是。我都有看到喔！」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "mu0203", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔，雖然這次小輸，但是下一次我一定會努力贏過那個混帳的……！」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "sn0117", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "眼前的景象看起來幾乎就是「跟媽媽報告成績的女兒們」，但我不會說出來的。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕～？」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "pn0070", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊嗯，比我預想的好太多了。櫻乃呢？」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「很滿意。」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 455, "voice": "sk0396", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也是喔，很滿意呢，欸嘿嘿。」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "mu0204", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來，在瀨名家裡一起念書的大家努力都有了回報，考出了不錯的成果。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "天羽學姊雖然沒有直接被瀨名教導，但也露出了開心的天使般的笑容。", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以啊，這都是多虧了小愛理，我就邀了小櫻乃來道謝了。」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "mu0205", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這麼說來，愛理的名次是？」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 455, "voice": "sk0397", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，我無所謂啦……」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0763", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然瀨名沒有回答，但大家同時看向了２年級的名次表。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "表單的最上方。那個閃閃發光的名字──「１　瀨名愛理（２－Ｔ）」。", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不愧是資優生，年級榜首就是固定位置！」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0319", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕～～♪」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "pn0071", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀啊啊！？」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0764", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇啊♪呵呵，小熊喵，妳是第一名的王冠呢！」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "mu0206", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕！」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "pn0072", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了好了，總之大家來拍紀念照吧？」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隨便都可以但是先把這隻動物抓下來啦！！！」", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0765", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「難得的王冠的說。」", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0320", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會遺憾第一名的位子嗎？」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "ht0167", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「動物跟年級榜首沒有關係吧！總之瓜生、快點、瓜生──！」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0766", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕～！」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "pn0073", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像小熊喵有兩隻一樣呢～」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "mu0207", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊哈啊……總、總之！」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0767", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "順帶一提，最後熊喵是趴在我的頭上。", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我只是做跟平常一樣的事情而已，沒什麼好誇獎的喔。」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0768", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「難得氣氛這麼熱絡，潑冷水就太不識趣了喔愛理同學～」", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0321", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然抱歉但安潔說的沒錯。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，瀨名依然……", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「拿我的事來熱絡有什麼意義啊？」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0769", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……因為大家都得到了好的成果。我真的鬆了口氣，畢竟是我教大家念書的。」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0770", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其他人彼此互看了一眼。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不、不過，念書準備考試是理所當然的，那也不是什麼值得誇獎的事……」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0771", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她在為大家的成果而高興。我們都看得出來她很努力不要顯露出這個心情。", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都笑了。", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼、哼嗯。」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0772", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名紅著臉把頭轉向一旁。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "班會快要開始了，大家解散後各自回去教室。", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理同學，謝謝妳～」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0322", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除了我行我素的隼太還是老樣子，安潔和乾同學都心情很好地走回自己的座位。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0773", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名，真的很謝謝妳。」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也在回座位前再次向她道謝。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就只有你，我才不想被你道謝呢。」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0774", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學又轉開頭。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只有我」。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為明白她話中的意思，所以即使是這種態度我也很開心。", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且……對、對我來說也挺新鮮的。」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0775", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你不是很完美地理解了我教的地方嗎？可以說是很有教導的價值……」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0776", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聽到她不好意思的語氣，我忍不住盯著瀨名的臉看。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你的那種地方、我、那個，不是奇怪的意思……還挺中意的。」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0777", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以那個，沒、沒什麼啦！」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0778", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名果然還是別開視線，但是她連耳朵都紅了。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是你很好教的意思喔！很有教的價值，所以那個……」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0779", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名。」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼啦！？」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0780", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳還願意再教我念書嗎？」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想也沒想就問了。", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她給我的感覺讓我想這麼問。", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0142", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar1146", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的點頭看起來有點高興──而我希望這不是我的錯覺。", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊……哈啊……安潔已經不行了，雖然期中考的成績很好提振了精神，可是這樣下去撐不到期末考試……」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 49, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0323", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳就是沒有考慮分配一口氣衝太猛了……」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0783", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在第三和第四節課中間的下課時間，我們正從理科教室走回原本的教室。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔、愛～理！」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "rk0057", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……媽媽。」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0784", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「～♪～～♪」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "rk0058", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然現身的學園長向大家打聲招呼後，一臉開心的表情湊到瀨名的身邊。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「蘭華小姐，您好像心情很好呢！」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0324", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「考試的結果我看到了喔♪」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "rk0059", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔復活得好快！」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理又是榜首呢～嗯，妳好努力喔！」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "rk0060", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哼嗯。」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0785", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "與開心的學園長相反，瀨名則是不爽地哼了一聲。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「託妳的福成績還可以。妳想說的只有這樣？」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0786", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「既然能考得這麼好，稍微放鬆點也沒關係的說。一直繃得這麼緊，弦會很容易斷喔～」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "rk0061", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔，現在的安潔對這句話有切身之痛。」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0325", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一旦放鬆，那條弦一定就再也沒用了。我是這麼想的，所以不會讓自己變成那樣。」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0787", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔，這邊的論點讓安潔感覺到器量的水準不一樣呢……！」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0326", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大概是因為安潔妳現在很虛弱，休息一會恢復體力比較好喔。」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "話說回來──", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在驚訝中又重新體認到了這個事實。", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這一對母女給人的印象本來就差很多，而現在她們說出口的話，根本是完全相反。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……期末也加油喔♪」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "rk0062", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我已經說了，不會鬆懈……」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0788", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是一個人住的條件對吧？自己說出口的話我不會違背的！」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0789", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學不耐煩地大喊。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──我只是做跟平常一樣的事情而已。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原來背後還有這層因素。我跟安潔面面相覷。", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "rk0063", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到我們的反應，學園長瞪圓了眼睛，不過立刻又露出愉快的微笑。", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小新吾和安潔，知道妳一個人住的事情啊。」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "rk0064", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣啊～哼嗯～欸嘿嘿……」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "rk0065", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我最討厭妳那種笑法了！」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0790", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要走了，瓜生、安潔。不好意思讓你們看到難堪的一幕……」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0791", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、啊好的！遵命！」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "ag0327", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就失陪了，學園長！」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好好好，再見囉，『瓜生』♪」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "rk0066", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔唔……！」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ar0792", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "直到最後氣氛都糟透了，學園長和瀨名各自走向左右兩邊。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟在瀨名身後。", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好像稍微瞭解了，但詳細情況實在是問不出口。我非常在意這對母女間的氣氛。", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我加快腳步，與瀨名並肩。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──她正緊咬著下唇。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真的問不出口。", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
